  "body": "The current spec says:\n If this.[[state]] is \"errored\" or \"closed\", return false.\n\nBut close() doesn't always make [[state]] \"closed\". When [[queue]] is not empty, it turns [[draining]] on and wait until [[queue]] gets empty.\nIt seems reasonable to ignore the enqueue call when the ReadableStream is in such state.\n",
